{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/testing/architecture/unused-primitive-method","title":"Unused primitive methods","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"unused-primitive-methods","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Unused primitive methods"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"assertNoUnusedPrimitiveMethods"},{"t":"text","text":" requires every method exposed by a primitive"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"insertion to have at least one call site in the project. An unused method is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"dead interface and should be removed from the primitive."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"function","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"removeUnusedPrimitiveMethods","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"graph"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"ArchitectureGraph","kind":"type"},{"text":") {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"assertNoUnusedPrimitiveMethods","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph.graph);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The check is graph-wide, so it can find a method declared in one module that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is never called by any component, service or feature module. This also applies"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"to CraftTS libraries included in the analyzed project: public methods must be"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"kept intentionally, or the project should exclude that library from the graph."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The error includes the primitive, method and declaration location:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"Primitive method state:counter.decrement is never used in this project (counter.ts:12). Remove it."}]}],"filena